---
title: "Drawbridge — Frontend build order: what to write, in what order, and when to stop"
---
flowchart TB
  subgraph P1["PHASE 1 · Aug 14–19 — ugly is fine, working is not optional"]
    direction LR
    C1["<b>App shell</b><br/>top bar, nav, page frame"]
    C2["<b>StatePill</b><br/>one component, ten states"]
    C3["<b>ReviewCard</b><br/>the queue row"]
    C4["<b>Timeline + TimelineEntry</b><br/>collapsed only"]
    C5["<b>GateCard</b> v1<br/>memo, decision, submit"]
    C6["<b>Vendor portal</b><br/>question, answer, upload"]
    C7["<b>Inbox simulator</b><br/>list of messages"]
  end

  subgraph P2["PHASE 2 · Aug 20–24 — the four pillars must be visible"]
    direction LR
    D1["<b>AdversarialBanner</b><br/>full-bleed, the only one"]
    D2["<b>TimelineEntry expanded</b><br/>goal, decision, model, cost, span"]
    D3["<b>ScoreDelta</b><br/>56 → 31 with the itemised modifier"]
    D4["<b>NeedsHumanCard</b> + DLQ panel"]
    D5["<b>FleetStatusStrip</b><br/>live counters in the top bar"]
    D6["<b>ActivityTicker</b><br/>policy blocks visible unprompted"]
  end

  subgraph P3["PHASE 3 · Aug 25–27 — polish is a scoring activity"]
    direction LR
    E1["<b>S0 judge entry</b><br/>three doors, live stats"]
    E2["<b>BinderView</b> + export"]
    E3["<b>TimeCompressionBadge</b><br/>shown whenever factor ≠ 1"]
    E4["<b>Empty states and skeletons</b><br/>never a spinner on a blank page"]
    E5["<b>Docs site</b><br/>five sections, diagrams embedded"]
  end

  STOP["<b>Aug 28 · feature freeze</b><br/>no new components. Demo-breaking bug fixes only.<br/>Everything below the cut line stays unbuilt: charts, settings,<br/>vendor CRUD, mobile, dark mode, auth."]

  C4 --> D1
  D3 --> E1
  E2 --> STOP

  classDef p1 fill:#dbeafe,stroke:#1d4ed8,stroke-width:2px,color:#1e3a8a
  classDef p2 fill:#fef3c7,stroke:#b45309,stroke-width:2px,color:#78350f
  classDef p3 fill:#dcfce7,stroke:#15803d,stroke-width:2px,color:#14532d
  classDef stop fill:#fee2e2,stroke:#b91c1c,stroke-width:2.5px,color:#7f1d1d
  class C1,C2,C3,C4,C5,C6,C7 p1
  class D1,D2,D3,D4,D5,D6 p2
  class E1,E2,E3,E4,E5 p3
  class STOP stop
